  "intro": [
    "Every S3 Tables control-plane operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane",
    "does with it. Tables are Iceberg-format; a table bucket, its namespaces and tables",
    "are managed over REST/JSON, signed with the `s3tables` credential scope, and there is",
    "no console action. An unset encryption, storage class or maintenance configuration",
    "reads back as the documented default rather than an empty answer.",
    "The emulator also serves an Iceberg REST catalog at `/iceberg` so a Spark job can",
    "create, load and commit tables; that is a data plane, not one of the operations below."
  ],
